1
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:07,819
桃園中壢的龍岡，有一片飄著雲南味道的眷村。
In Longgang, Taoyuan, lies a village that smells of Yunnan.

2
00:00:15,669 --> 00:00:20,275
1949年，一支雲南國軍撤入緬甸邊境。
In 1949, a Nationalist army from Yunnan retreated into Burma.

3
00:00:20,925 --> 00:00:25,555
他們在滇緬泰金三角的叢林裡，苦撐多年。
For years, they held on in the jungles of the Golden Triangle.

4
00:00:28,605 --> 00:00:33,954
1953到1954年，第一批孤軍與眷屬搭機來臺。
In 1953–54, the first soldiers and families were flown to Taiwan.

5
00:00:34,604 --> 00:00:37,958
近七千人輾轉落腳在桃園龍岡。
Nearly seven thousand of them settled in Longgang, Taoyuan.

6
00:00:40,408 --> 00:00:44,835
1954年秋天，忠貞新村在這裡建成。
In the autumn of 1954, Zhongzhen New Village was built here.

7
00:00:45,485 --> 00:00:48,825
漂泊的異鄉人，終於有了新的家。
The wanderers finally had a new home.

8
00:00:51,275 --> 00:00:55,558
他們開墾荒地，種菜，也種家鄉的香料。
They cleared wasteland to grow vegetables and hometown spices.

9
00:00:56,208 --> 00:01:00,649
吃不完的拿出來賣，慢慢形成了忠貞市場。
They sold the surplus, and Zhongzhen Market slowly took shape.

10
00:01:03,099 --> 00:01:06,843
米干，是把在來米磨成米漿做成的。
Mi gan is made from ground indica rice batter.

11
00:01:07,493 --> 00:01:13,189
米漿淋上圓盤，一盤一盤蒸成薄片，再切成寬條。
Batter is steamed tray by tray into sheets, then cut into wide strips.

12
00:01:13,839 --> 00:01:18,271
澆上熬了一夜的高湯與肉醬，就是家鄉味。
Topped with overnight broth and meat sauce, it tastes of home.

13
00:01:20,721 --> 00:01:25,092
2011年起，桃園每年舉辦龍岡米干節。
Since 2011, Taoyuan has held the Longgang Rice Noodle Festival.

14
00:01:25,742 --> 00:01:30,195
用一碗米干，說出金三角的多元族群文化。
A bowl of noodles tells of the Golden Triangle's many cultures.

15
00:01:33,045 --> 00:01:37,619
潑水節灑出清涼水花，把祝福送給彼此。
At the Water-Splashing Festival, cool water carries blessings.

16
00:01:41,069 --> 00:01:45,736
長街宴擺開長桌，大家一起分享滇緬美食。
At the Long Street Banquet, everyone shares Yunnan-Burmese food.

17
00:01:48,786 --> 00:01:52,839
入夜後點起火把，火舞照亮整條街。
At night, torches are lit and fire dancers light up the street.

18
00:01:53,489 --> 00:01:57,876
米干節也獲選為臺灣國際級的特色觀光活動。
The festival is now one of Taiwan's international-class events.

19
00:02:00,326 --> 00:02:04,446
如今，忠貞新村文化園區與異域故事館，
Today, the Zhongzhen Village Cultural Park and Lost Army Museum

20
00:02:05,096 --> 00:02:08,362
靜靜保存著孤軍一路走來的記憶。
quietly keep the memories of the soldiers' long journey.

21
00:02:10,812 --> 00:02:14,678
一碗米干，裝著漂泊半世紀的鄉愁，
A bowl of mi gan holds half a century of homesickness,

22
00:02:15,328 --> 00:02:18,451
也裝著在這片土地扎根的勇氣。
and the courage to take root in this land.

23
00:02:19,101 --> 00:02:24,052
下次來龍岡，慢慢吃一碗，聽聽他們的故事。
Next time in Longgang, savor a bowl, and listen to their story.

